    "detailed_description": "The final exams are here ! Unfortunately, you're not prepared enough. You'll need some serious cheating skills to get through this week unharmed...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/a3c5e14781c29be1b03c2b6d19fd9117.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div><br><br>Cheat or Die is a small indie puzzle game where you have to help <strong>Mathilde</strong> cheat during her final exams.<br><br>The game takes place at Hartmann School, a well-established but intimidating school controlled by a terrifying <strong>Supervisor</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/7bdc496ef1b2e7113868ec634fb6fddd.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple perks &amp; bonus to choose from in order to cheat more effectively<br></li><li> A list of 10 levels of increased level of challenge, with various classrooms and numbers of students<br></li><li> Multiple character dialogues adding to the story around the finals week<br></li><li> The Supervisors gets stronger and stronger the better your grades are...</li></ul><br>...and who knows, you may find some friends along the way...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/39f769174fabcfbcfb1e1d6382da47c6.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "The final exams are here ! Unfortunately, you're not prepared enough. You'll need some serious cheating skills to get through this week unharmed...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/a3c5e14781c29be1b03c2b6d19fd9117.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div><br><br>Cheat or Die is a small indie puzzle game where you have to help <strong>Mathilde</strong> cheat during her final exams.<br><br>The game takes place at Hartmann School, a well-established but intimidating school controlled by a terrifying <strong>Supervisor</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/7bdc496ef1b2e7113868ec634fb6fddd.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple perks &amp; bonus to choose from in order to cheat more effectively<br></li><li> A list of 10 levels of increased level of challenge, with various classrooms and numbers of students<br></li><li> Multiple character dialogues adding to the story around the finals week<br></li><li> The Supervisors gets stronger and stronger the better your grades are...</li></ul><br>...and who knows, you may find some friends along the way...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381280/extras/39f769174fabcfbcfb1e1d6382da47c6.avif?t=1600444848\" /></div>",
